		"\1\b[22]If you've been enjoying %(_thatsunnyweather) today, then you're in luck because it'll be continuing just the same tomorrow!\n\n Forecasts are calling for the current weather patterns to hold for the next 24 hours at least, and if you stay tuned we'll keep giving YOU all the latest weather information on the #1 weather source you can trust, (TODO WEATHER STATION)."
		
		_sunnyweather = ("sunny weather","cloudy skies","rainfall","worminess","sneezy weather","electric bursts","psionic interference")[Weather.Today]
		"\1\b[22]All our forecasts today show that the current weather patterns will hold, so tomorrow you can expect to see the same %(_sunnyweather) that we're having today. If you're traveling, make sure that you're factoring in how that may affect your route!\n\n Whether you're on the road or staying at home, stay tuned, and we'll keep YOU updated on where the weather is going next here at (TODO WEATHER STATION)."
		
		_sunnyskies = ("sunny skies","cloudy days","rain showers","to watch the worm migrations","breezy days and you don't have allergies","having the dead batteries in your drawer suddenly recharge themselves","feeling the tingles from the potential psionic energy in the air")[Weather.Today]
		_thatsunis = ("that sun is","those clouds are","these showers are","the worm migration is","these high winds are","the high levels of electricity in the air are","this psionic storm shows no signs of stopping and is")[Weather.Today]
		_stockupon = ("regularly apply sunscreen","get out while they can and enjoy the cooler weather","wear rain boots and keep an eye on their snails","watch where they step; you never know where those worms might get to","get out their battery testers, and make sure to have a spare radio just in case","watch what they're thinking today, and maybe consider picking up a special psychic energy-proof hat")[Weather.Today]
		"\1\b[22]Well, if you like %(_sunnyskies) then you're in luck, because %(_thatsunis) going to continue right into tomorrow. We're advising everyone to %(_stockupon)!\n\n Make sure to check back with us tomorrow, and we at (TODO WEATHER STATION) will keep YOU updated on whatever the weather has in store for us next!"
		
