	"\1\b[22]And now we're going to take a look at the temperatures over in%(emdash) whoa! Hahaha, %(besttoavoid(_snailcity))\n\n We'll come back around to %(_snailcity) once we've got our equipment functioning properly again. For now, let's move on to %(_snailcity2), where the temperatures look more reasonable!"
	"\1\b[22]This just in, I'm getting reports about a massive storm cloud brewing over %(_snailcity)! This might be a big one folks!\n\n ... Oh, what's that? Hold on a moment, I'm getting new information that the cloud is actually just %(fromabbq(_snailcity))! False alarm, phew! But rest assured that if there WAS a sudden weather event, we at (TODO STATION NAME) would get you information as fast as it becomes available, and maybe even faster!"
	//"\1\b[22]"
