	"And we're back, folks!\n\n Haha, did you miss us?\n\n We missed YOU! And to show our appreciation for our listeners who waited for us, how about a special coupon code?\n\n %(snailpic) \f[italic,1]Whoa! Woohoo!\f[italic,default]\n\n I think that's a great idea, Bill! Let's see what we have... TODOCOUPONCODE10! (TODO something something what it's used for?)\n\n What a deal! And that's our thanks to you, our most loyal listeners. Now, back to the show!\e:chain=end"
}}CHAIN

