}}CHAIN


//Nelly Norma & Nobop
RadioStation.Pirate_Radio : nonoverlap_pool
{
	//"\1\b[20]get a life, snails"
	"\1\b[22]So how's the family been, Nobop?\n\n %(slugpic) You know how it is with 400 siblings. Some days it's like ""I love my family more than life itself"", other days it's like ""GOBOP, UBOP, STOP TRYING TO GET INTO THE SALT IT WILL LITERALLY KILL YOU!""\n\n Haha, I know that feeling!"
}

Ads.General : nonoverlap_pool
{
	//"\1\b[20]it's an ad!"
	
	//Super Sponges - sudsy snails sing songs
	"\1\b[22]If you need sponges%(emdash)\w8and who doesn't, these days%(emdash)\w8they should be colorful and fun!\n\n We've got sponges in all kinds of colors, shapes, and sizes, so come on down with your snail and pick out the one that really makes it go ""wow""!\n\n \f[italic,1]Super Sponges\f[italic,default]. Sudsy snails sing songs."
	"\1\b[22]When you pull out your sponge for your snail's daily shell washing, does its face light up with joy at the sight? If not, then it's time to upgrade your sponge!\n\n Come on down to \f[italic,1]Super Sponges\f[italic,default], where we have LOADS of sponges in all kinds of designs and colors. Find just the right one for your snail that makes it wiggle with joy!\n\n \f[italic,1]Super Sponges\f[italic,default]. Sudsy snails sing songs."
	"\1\b[22]Clean snails are happy snails, and for the best and easiest clean, you should use fresh, high quality sponges!\n\n At \f[italic,1]Super Sponges\f[italic,default] we have only the best sponges, available in a variety of styles, colors, and textures. If you need a sponge, we've got a sponge, and the workmanship of each sponge is guaranteed or your lettuce back.\n\n We're sure you and your snail will find something you'll love, and have many happy washes together!\n\n \f[italic,1]Super Sponges\f[italic,default]. Sudsy snails sing songs."
	
	//Harvey's Snail Emporium - no matter the snail, we've got just what you need!
	"\1\b[22]Need snail supplies? Whatever you need, you can find it at \f[italic,1]Harvey's Snail Emporium\f[italic,default]! We've got sponges, we've got towels, we've got flags, banners, stickers, climbing walls, nutritional supplements, and so much more!\n\n Come on down with your snail today, and you're sure to find something you can't live without!\n\n \f[italic,1]Harvey's Snail Emporium\f[italic,default]. No matter the snail, we've got just what you need!"
	"\1\b[22]Does your snail need more enrichment in its life? Could it use a new hobby to spice things up? Stop by \f[italic,1]Harvey's Snail Emporium\f[italic,default] today, and we'll help you find just the thing to keep your snail happy and healthy!\n\n We've got snail bicycles, snail activity books, bubble bath solution, costumes, gardening tools, scrapbooking kits, disposable cameras, and so much more! No snail will leave without something new to try!\n\n \f[italic,1]Harvey's Snail Emporium\f[italic,default]. All the things you and your snail didn't know you needed!"
	"\1\b[22]If you need snail supplies, look no further than \f[italic,1]Harvey's Snail Emporium\f[italic,default]! We've got nutritional supplements, carrying boxes, cooking oil, skillets, training equipment, racer ID services, and so much more! Everything snail-related you could possibly need, we've got it, so stop on by and see what we can do for you!\n\n \f[italic,1]Harvey's Snail Emporium\f[italic,default]. No matter the snail, we've got just what you need!"
	
	//Good Greens - nutrition your snail will love
	"\1\b[22]Healthy snails start with a healthy diet, and a healthy diet starts with healthy ingredients. At \f[italic,1]Good Greens\f[italic,default], we provide a variety of fruits and vegetables to choose from and construct a natural and balanced diet for your snail.\n\n Lettuce. Cabbage. Spinach. Arugula. Kale. Green beans. Snap peas. We've got them all. Bring your snail today and browse our selection.\n\n \f[italic,1]Good Greens\f[italic,default]. Nutrition your snail will love."
	"\1\b[22]Is your snail's diet green enough? Lettuce is a fine starting point, but have you tried deeper greens such as spinach or kale?\n\n At \f[italic,1]Good Greens\f[italic,default], we believe every snail deserves the greenest diet possible. Bring your snail and browse our selection of the finest fruits and vegetables, all as green as can be. Apples, bell peppers, jalapeños, kiwis, cat grass, and so much more. Fill your basket with the delicious hues of nature.\n\n \f[italic,1]Good Greens\f[italic,default]. Nutrition your snail will love."
	"\1\b[22]Your snail's plate should be a delightful medley of vibrant greens. Cucumbers, zucchini, basil, pears, unripe bananas%(emdash) all this and more have been found to be the #1 way to support your snail's health.\n\n At \f[italic,1]Good Greens\f[italic,default], we have everything you need to fulfill your snail's dietary needs. Bring your snail today and browse our selection of the most delectable shades on the market. But be warned; if you aren't hungry when you walk in, you will be by the time you walk out!\n\n \f[italic,1]Good Greens\f[italic,default]. Nutrition your snail will love."
	
	//Lettuce Lovers - for all your lettuce needs!
	"\1\b[22]\f[italic,1]It's cash money, honey!\f[italic,default]\n\n If you need Lettuce services, \f[italic,1]Lettuce Lovers\f[italic,default] have got you covered! Money lettuce to food lettuce and back again; lettuce washing; wilted leaves exchanged for fresh leaves; and all with minimal fees!\n\n \f[italic,1]Lettuce Lovers\f[italic,default]. For all your lettuce needs!" //IS LETTUCE WASHING NOT JUST MONEY LAUNDERING THO................... also I'm not sure about the "it's cash money, honey" it just would not leave me lol
	"\1\b[22]If you've got lettuce, we've got services for you! Get your lettuce cleaned, converted, or replaced with fresher leaves, with no surprise fees or hidden stipulations! Trust \f[italic,1]Lettuce Lovers\f[italic,default] with your hard earned greens, and we'll make your leaves work for you.\n\n \f[italic,1]Lettuce Lovers\f[italic,default]. For all your lettuce needs!"
	"\1\b[22]Got greens? Get 'em cleaned, converted, or any other service you need at \f[italic,1]Lettuce Lovers\f[italic,default]! For minimal fees, we can convert money lettuce to food lettuce, and vice versa! We'll wash it, dry it, and we'll even exchange your wilted leaves for fresh ones!\n\n \f[italic,1]Lettuce Lovers\f[italic,default]. For all your lettuce needs!" //please note that the service of upgrading your wilted leaves to fresh ones incurs an extra fee...
	
	//Shell Shiners - look your best for your win! (idk if this is the right tagline but I want them to make the point that if you're dirty when you win you'll always regret it. Imagine the newspaper photos! The magazines! All with a dirty shell!? unthinkable!!)
	//TODO shell shiners is also the name of a shell polish that is on bill and blanca's channel... I think it's ok to share the name because it's just them selling one of their products. Hm!
	"\1\b[22]\f[italic,1]Wow! Amazing! How did you do it? What brand of engine do you use?\f[italic,default]\n\n Hear that? It's a crowd of adoring fans after you win that big race. There's just \f[italic,1]one\f[italic,default] little problem...\n\n \f[italic,1]Oh my, are those soot stains on your shell? Gasp! Oh, yuck, these pictures won't come out well at all...\f[italic,default]\n\n Uh oh. Your big moment's finally come, but a dirty shell is ruining everything.\n\n \f[italic,1]Lets just... give it some space. Maybe if we get better lighting in here it will help...\f[italic,default]\n\n Don't let that be you. You deserve to have everyone singing your praises when you win, so why let a little dirt get in the way? At \f[italic,1]Shell Shiners\f[italic,default], we'll give you a professional wash and wax so that you look your very best when all the cameras are finally pointed at you.\n\n \f[italic,1]Oh wow, so shiny! You're definitely going on the front cover of this week's magazine!\f[italic,default]\n\n \f[italic,1]Shell Shiners\f[italic,default]. Look your best for your win."
	"\1\b[22]\f[italic,1]Hey! Over here!\f[italic,default]\n\n Well, would you look at that. It's an adoring fan that recognized you on your way to the store.\n\n \f[italic,1]Can you autograph this for me? Ooh, could we get a snailfie!?\f[italic,default]\n\n Uh oh. A picture that will be seen by potentially millions of others, there's just one little problem...\n\n \f[italic,1]Ooh, um, maybe we should try from this side instead? You've got a little...\f[italic,default]\n\n Dirt on your shell. How embarassing. This could haunt you for the rest of your career. But how can you turn down a fan?\n\n \f[italic,1]Hmm, this isn't really coming out how I'd hoped... but I guess it'll have to do!\f[italic,default]\n\n Nobody wants to be in that position. Don't let it be you. At \f[italic,1]Shell Shiners\f[italic,default], we'll give your shell a professional wash and wax so that you can be prepared for any time the cameras come out, whether it's on the racetrack or meeting fans in the street.\n\n \f[italic,1]Aw, how cute! Your shell is so glossy, it's perfect.\f[italic,default]\n\n \f[italic,1]Shell Shiners\f[italic,default]. Look your best for your fans."
	"\1\b[22]\f[italic,1]Alright, now let's get a picture of you with this hat and bandanna...\f[italic,default]\n\n You've finally made it. Your name's become big enough that magazines want to write articles about you, and it's photoshoot day. There's just one little problem...\n\n \f[italic,1]Hm, this wax job isn't even, we'll have to try from a different angle...\f[italic,default]\n\n You thought you'd do a ""DIY"" wash and wax at home. But with professional cameras trained on you, it's ended up disastrous.\n\n \f[italic,1]Ah, this spot isn't glossy at all! We'll have to redo all of this and try again in an hour.\f[italic,default]\n\n Not a good look. Will the magazine even approve your pictures? Will they want you back? Maybe they will, but straining your professional relationships is never a good thing.\n\n \f[italic,1]I'll have to call my next appointment and let them know we'll be running late...\f[italic,default]\n\n Don't let it be you. At \f[italic,1]Shell Shiners\f[italic,default], we'll give your shell a professional wash and wax to make life easy and simple for those you work with. They're sure to appreciate it, and who wouldn't want to invite back a snail that considerate?\n\n \f[italic,1]Just hold still and we'll get a few pictures from each side... perfect!\f[italic,default]\n\n \f[italic,1]Shell shiners\f[italic,default]. Look your best for picture day."
	
	//Enchanted Escargot - for a truly magical dining experience (Do I want this to be more subtle though, hmmm...)
	//Enchanted Entrées...
	"\1\b[22]A private moment away from the day to day. Imagine it: just you, your snail, and that beautiful New Snail City skyline.\n\n A delectable first bite, flavors that sing on your tongue until the very last morsel.\n\n \f[italic,1]Enchanted Entrées\f[italic,default]. A truly magical dining experience."
	"\1\b[22]Up here, high above the city, you can indulge in your most decadent cravings. Go on, order what you like, we won't tell a soul.\n\n The escargot? An excellent choice, if I do say so myself...\n\n \f[italic,1]Enchanted Entrées\f[italic,default]. Only top quality snails served." //But... but does it mean....... or............
	"\1\b[22]Hear the sizzle as your plate is brought to your table. Butter, olive oil, garlic; a heavenly olfactory experience before you've even had a chance to raise your fork to your lips.\n\n When you're ready, go ahead and dig in... An unforgettable meal awaits.\n\n \f[italic,1]Enchanted Entrées\f[italic,default]. A dining experience like no other."
	
	//Jim's Gym (lol we could rename this) - strong snails bring in the lettuce
	"\1\b[22]IT'S TIME TO GET \f[bold,1]PUMPED\f[bold,default] AT JIM'S GYM! BRING YOUR SNAILS FOR THEIR DAILY SHELL PRESSES AND \f[bold,1]BUILD UP THOSE MUSCLES!!!\f[bold,default]\n\n STRONG SNAILS WIN RACES, STRONG SNAILS GET FANS, \f[bold,1]STRONG SNAILS BRING IN THE LETTUCE!\f[bold,default]"
	"\1\b[22]IF YOUR SNAIL ISN'T OUT THERE CLIMBING WALLS TO BUILD UP ITS STRENGTH, WHAT'S EVEN THE POINT OF HAVING A SNAIL!? BRING IT TO JIM'S GYM, WE'VE GOT THE MOST CHALLENGING CLIMBING WALLS THIS SIDE OF SNAILOPOLIS!\n\n STRONG SNAILS WIN RACES, STRONG SNAILS GET FANS, \f[bold,1]STRONG SNAILS BRING IN THE LETTUCE!\f[bold,default]"
	"\1\b[22]CAN YOUR SNAIL SHELL PRESS 30 ADORING FANS ON ITS BACK AT ONCE? IF NOT, \f[bold,1]WHY NOT!? \f[bold,default]GET IT A MEMBERSHIP AT JIM'S GYM TODAY AND \f[bold,1]FIX THAT!\f[bold,default]\n\n STRONG SNAILS WIN RACES, STRONG SNAILS GET FANS, \f[bold,1]STRONG SNAILS BRING IN THE LETTUCE!\f[bold,default]"
	
	//Perfect Paint Job - where every coat is personal (?)
	"\1\b[22]Red. Blue. Yellow.\n\n Every snail wants a stunning shell.\n\n Gloss, or matte? Plain... or \f[italic,1]stripes?\f[italic,default]\n\n Give them the chance to express their innermost desires boldly, and show them off to the world.\n\n \f[italic,1]Perfect Paint Job\f[italic,default]. Where every coat is personal."
	"\1\b[22]A glossy sheen. Color with fabulous depth. Brilliance in every stroke.\n\n Personalized patterns. Thousands of options. A custom-made delight.\n\n Your snail deserves the best to express itself.\n\n \f[italic,1]Perfect Paint Job\f[italic,default]. Where every coat is personal."
	"\1\b[22]What will it be? Spots, speckles, stripes?\n\n Perhaps you'd like a blend of all three?\n\n Or... perhaps you like the bold confidence evoked by a solid color shell? We have many high quality paints for a stunning monochrome look.\n\n \f[italic,1]Perfect Paint Job\f[italic,default]. Where every coat is personal."
	
	//Power Pistons - the power you need to reach the finish line, first time every time.
	"\1\b[22]When it comes to racing, we all know that a powerful engine is the most important factor in your snail's speed.\n\n \f[italic,1]Vrrrrooooooommmmm!\f[italic,default]\n\n Don't skimp out. Get the reliable power your snail needs to reach the finish line, first time every time.\n\n \f[italic,1]Power Pistons\f[italic,default]."
	"\1\b[22]When it comes to converting horsepower to snail power, you want the most efficient engine possible. Sure, there are lots of generic alternatives on the market%(emdash) but only \f[italic,1]Power Pistons\f[italic,default] has the high quality workmanship to ensure you get every bit of speed you pay for, with no mid-race breakdowns or explosions.\n\n Get the reliable power your snail needs to reach the finish line, first time every time.\n\n \f[italic,1]Power Pistons\f[italic,default]."
	"\1\b[22]When it comes to reliability, nothing beats an original \f[italic,1]Power Pistons\f[italic,default] engine. Hand crafted high-quality workmanship, made to last a lifetime.\n\n Every engine we design goes through extensive testing to ensure it can withstand even the harshest of snail racing conditions. For short races or marathons, in clear skies or inclement weather, whether it's fresh from the factory or has had years of service%(emdash) a%(br)\f[italic,1]Power Pistons\f[italic,default] engine is ready to roar into action at any time.\n\n Get the reliable power your snail needs to reach the finish line, first time every time.\n\n \f[italic,1]Power Pistons\f[italic,default]."
	
	//Mollusk Massage - every snail deserves a spa day
	//"\1\b[22]"
	//"\1\b[22]"
	//"\1\b[22]"
	
	//Gastropod Gardens - a bird-free paradise for your snails to roam
	//"\1\b[22]"
	//"\1\b[22]"
	//"\1\b[22]"
	
	//Snailville Auction House - everything you could ever want, and then some! - does it feel too much like harvey's snail emporium? hmm
	//"\1\b[22]"
	//"\1\b[22]"
	//"\1\b[22]"
	
	//Nature's Nitro - nutrients to unlock your snail's true potential
	"\1\b[22]Is your snail reaching its true potential?%(br)Most snails don't.\n\n A variety of fruits and vegetables will keep it healthy, sure, but spreading out as much as possible means you aren't dialing in on the specific nutrients that will give your snail that extra edge.\n\n Our nutritional supplements boost four essential vitamins: vitamins S, N, A1, and L. Together, these vitamins can enhance your snail's alertness, critical thinking skills, and%(br)aerodynamics. Taking just one tablet daily can unlock the true power hidden within your snail, helping it to perform its best on the racetrack.\n\n \f[italic,1]Nature's Nitro\f[italic,default]. Speed, the natural way." //are the vitamins too obvious lol - TODO maybe i should make A1 be A\f[sup,1]1\f[sup,default]???
	"\1\b[22]Does your snail seem lethargic and sad? Does it have trouble meeting expectations on the racetrack? Does its mucus seem a little... ""off""?\n\n Your snail isn't alone. It might be one of millions suffering from a vitamin deficiency. Studies have shown that boosting your snail's levels of vitamins S, N, A1, and L can improve its vitality significantly, elevating mood and boosting racing ability.\n\n At \f[italic,1]Nature's Nitro\f[italic,default], we've formulated an easy-to-swallow once-a-day tablet that will boost the levels of these essential vitamins in your snail to get its levels back to normal, and beyond.\n\n \f[italic,1]Nature's Nitro\f[italic,default]. Speed, the natural way." //"and beyond" doing a lot of heavy lifting there lol. if you, dear code snooper, don't know: too many vitamins can make you very, VERY sick
	"\1\b[22]Do you wish your snail had more of a ""spring"" in its step? Sure, maybe it looks fine on the surface, but you know it isn't reaching its true potential. That's where \f[italic,1]Nature's Nitro\f[italic,default] can help.\n\n Our nutritional supplements can boost your snail's vitamin levels off the charts, giving it everything it needs for a speed boost - and all without any artificial flavors, colors, or anything else not made by mother nature herself.\n\n Buyers like you report their snails are more focused and alert with just one tablet a day. That small edge can be the difference between a sweeping victory and a crushing defeat when you're competing at the top levels.\n\n \f[italic,1]Nature's Nitro\f[italic,default]. Speed, the natural way."
	
	//Snail Sounds - soothe your snail to sleep with the comforting sounds of nature (including things like bird calls lol, put fear into their snaily hearts)
	"\1\b[22]Many farm-raised snails have never had the chance to explore their roots. They've never slid through the woods, under canopies of leaves, up and down trees, and eaten from the delicious fruits that grow best in the wild.\n\n Give your snail a taste of nature today, with the soothing sounds of the forest. Crunching twigs, creaking branches, calling birds, and somewhere in the distance... a serene waterfall.\n\n \f[italic,1]Snail Sounds\f[italic,default]. The gift of nature."
	"\1\b[22]Does your snail seem stressed out and overwhelmed with the pace and demands of modern life? Know that you're not alone. Snails weren't made for our cities and towns, and many find the sensations to be just too much.\n\n But now, you can give your snail a much-needed reprieve. For a little lettuce, you can buy our premium soundscape CDs and give your snail a serene moment, anytime, anywhere. Wind over a meadow, bees buzzing around flowers, the beating of wings, a bubbling brook...\n\n \f[italic,1]Snail Sounds\f[italic,default]. The gift of nature."
	"\1\b[22]Does your snail find it hard to sleep at night? Do the unnatural sounds or odd silence of your human home put it on edge? It's no surprise, your snail's ancestors lived in the wild, leaving it with a deep longing for nature.\n\n But instead of putting your snail out in the cold every night, our premium soundscapes offer a convenient solution. Simply play one of dozens of high definition audio tracks we've captured directly from nature, and your snail can have a little piece of the wild at home.\n\n The gentle crash of waves at the beach, the scuttling of a crab across the sand, the cries of a gull, the subtle swaying of grass... All captured with exceptional clarity.\n\n \f[italic,1]Snail Sounds\f[italic,default]. The gift of nature."
	
	//Snack Shack - any appetite sated! (snacks for humans and snails... includes escargot lol)
	"\1\b[22]Picture this: you've been running around all day, and you and your snail are HUNGRY. But your refrigerator is at home, so far away... Do you really wanna go all the way back there, spend FOREVER prepping a meal, and then make your way back out to continue your errands?\n\n NO! Nobody does! And that's why we invented snack shack. Come by any time at one of multiple locations in YOUR city, and we'll have you fed in no time at all!\n\n \f[italic,1]Snack Shack\f[italic,default]. Any appetite sated!"
	"\1\b[22]You're hungry, right? Well if you're not, then you will be! You should fix that! And what better way to do it than to drop by one of our fine establishments?\n\n We've got burgers for you, lettuce for your snail, milkshakes for the both of you%(emdash) and so much more! No matter what it is you're craving right now, I guarantee you we've got it or my name's not Moe.\n\n \f[italic,1]Snack Shack\f[italic,default]. Any appetite sated!"
	"\1\b[22]Got a mouth? Then we've got something for you down at \f[italic,1]Snack Shack\f[italic,default]! Any creature with a mouth needs to eat eventually, and why not make mealtime great?\n\n Got snails? Bring em down for a delicious meal at half price! Treat yourself to a milkshake or a pudding pie while you're here! When you need quick food, comfort food, tasty food, WHATEVER food, we've got you covered at \f[italic,1]Snack Shack\f[italic,default].\n\n \f[italic,1]Snack Shack\f[italic,default]. Any appetite sated!"
	
	//Racer Rugs - turn any floor into a practice track!
	"\1\b[22]Have you tried setting up race tracks at home before? It's a real pain, isn't it? They take up so much room, and require a lot of maintenance.\n\n Well let those woes be a thing of the past; our team of scientists has been hard at work developing a new product that can fill the same role without all the drawbacks! Introducing \f[italic,1]Racer Rugs\f[italic,default], a stylish rug with a sleek racetrack design that you can simply lay down on any flat surface.\n\n The rug's markings give your snail a clear guide to follow while it practices its turns and sprints, and cleanup is a breeze! The rug material is resistant to mucus stains, you can use a vacuum cleaner to clean up any dust and debris, and the whole thing is machine washable!\n\n \f[italic,1]Racer Rugs\f[italic,default]. Turn any floor into a practice track."
	"\1\b[22]Does your livingroom look a little bland? Could you use some new decor, and something to spice up your snail's life?\n\n Then you need \f[italic,1]Racer Rugs\f[italic,default]! These stylish rugs have a track design so your snail can practice any time from the comfort of home, and you won't lose any floor space! If you get creative, you can even place other furniture such as coffee tables in the center of the rug, where they won't cover the track.\n\n \f[italic,1]Racer Rugs\f[italic,default]. Turn any floor into a practice track!"
	"\1\b[22]You've heard of \f[italic,1]Racer Rugs\f[italic,default], but did you know they actually come in multiple sizes and styles?\n\n Everything from small throw rugs with circular tracks to large rugs with oval tracks that will fill your whole livingroom. We've even got runners with one way sprint tracks on them!\n\n No matter what shape or size of home you have, you're sure to find a rug that you and your snail will love.\n\n \f[italic,1]Racer Rugs\f[italic,default]. Turn any floor into a practice track!"
	
